# Zone 1, room 1 (grey box, Phase 1 task 7): tech 1, dash-slash.
# BUILD.md s5, tech 1: "Dash into attack, frame-perfect cancel. Taught by a tight corridor of weak
# enemies"; s5 Dash: "cancelable into attack from frame 6"; s6 Taper (side 1: 10 damage, box 68 x 44 u).
#
# Layout: the west hall (25 tiles) with one dummy (the first encounter: it stands still and does not
# swing; one slash kills it, it comes back 60 ticks later), then a corridor 76 tiles (2432 u) long and
# 2 tiles (64 u) high, then the east hall. The corridor is as low as a dummy is tall, so there is no
# jumping over them. Every dummy here is solid (marker `solid=1`): a body the player cannot pass while
# it lives, so a run or a dash stops at the first one and only a kill clears the way. The ten corridor
# dummies (hp 10: one side slash kills one) stand 240 u apart from x 880 to 3040, all swinging in step
# (marker `attack=1 period=30`: a white swing 64 u long every 78 ticks, 24 telegraph, 4 active, 20
# recovery, then 30 idle). A killed dummy's body is gone until it comes back 60 ticks later.
#
# What the room measures (tests/replay/zone1/01_*, hall dummy and ten corridor dummies, all killed):
#   dash-slash chain (a dash, a slash on the dash's frames 6 to 9, a dash again as the ground
#     cooldown allows): 357 ticks to the east door, no hit taken (5 hearts);
#   running slashes (the best a plain attacker does, slashing the moment a dummy is in reach): 429
#     ticks (72 more), no hit taken (zone1_01_control_run_slashes);
#   dashing without slashing (a dash every 24 ticks): stopped by the first corridor dummy, never
#     crosses (zone1_01_control_dash_only);
#   running without slashing: stopped the same way (zone1_01_control_run).
# Why the tech wins: a dash is 20 u/f for 5 to 6 frames against the run's 9 u/f, and the slash on
# frame 6 kills the dummy that stops the dash; each of the ten dummies costs about 7 ticks less than
# the plain attacker pays, and the dash itself is not enough: it stops at a body.
room zone1/01_dash_slash
size 114 34
spawn 96 832
tiles
